WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.966
There are all kinds of families.

00:00:10.433 --> 00:00:14.333
There are small families and big families.

00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:20.866
Some are loud. Some are quiet.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:26.933
Families play together and work together.

00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:31.166
Families look after each other.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:38.166
Just like friends. Friends are our families, too!

00:00:39.066 --> 00:00:45.366
Friends have fun together. They laugh and spend time together.

00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:54.066
And they help each other. This is Laura and Andres.

00:00:55.233 --> 00:00:59.199
And this is their family. But where are they?

00:01:01.433 --> 00:01:04.966
They are on a big farm in the mountains in Colombia.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:10.566
They live and work here. They grow coffee plants.

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:15.833
Colombia is famous for good coffee.

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:19.933
Laura helps her father.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:26.366
They pick the fruit and collect the good beans.

00:01:29.466 --> 00:01:34.666
This is Ji-woo. She is 13 years old.

00:01:37.333 --> 00:01:39.999
She lives in Seoul, South Korea.

00:01:41.233 --> 00:01:47.299
But her grandmother lives far away in the south, on Jeju Island.

00:01:51.633 --> 00:01:54.533
She is a 'Haenyeo', a 'sea woman'.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:02.433
The women on this island swim in the water and look for food.

00:02:03.866 --> 00:02:07.632
They can stay under water for three to four minutes!

00:02:09.333 --> 00:02:14.299
The women are very close. They look after each other.

00:02:15.133 --> 00:02:18.999
Some sea women are 80 years old and still work!

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:23.800
Ji-woo's dream is to be like her grandmother.

00:02:26.333 --> 00:02:30.466
Families, including our friends, are fantastic!

00:02:32.733 --> 00:02:36.333
Things are not always perfect, but your family

00:02:38.833 --> 00:02:42.966
and friends are always there for you.